{"a":[217,217],"h":"<p>cevaben de ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"93\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 92.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.0 30.0 45.7 45.7 56.2 63.0 69.7 69.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"63.0 76.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bunda bir kıtal<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"65\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 65.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 24.0 30.7 30.7 37.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 48.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> büyük bir günahtır.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 41.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 24.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> fakat<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.6 53.3 53.3 63.8 70.6 70.6 97.6 97.6 108.0 126.0 126.0 126.0 135.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"77.3 77.3 108.0 135.0 148.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah yolundan, dini haktan meni'<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 89.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 39.0 39.0 46.4 46.4 53.3 53.3 64.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"64.4 72.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve Allaha küfür<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"155\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 155.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.3 30.0 37.4 50.3 50.3 57.7 73.4 73.4 82.4 82.4 95.3 107.3 116.3 116.3 123.7 130.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25