/svg> ve siz müslümanlardan her hangi biriniz dininden döner<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 147.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 24.0 24.0 30.7 37.4 57.7 66.0 66.0 75.0 92.3 92.3 108.7 108.7 117.7 124.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.4 57.7 75.0 117.7 124.4 131.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> de kâfir olarak irtıdaddan tevbe etmiyerek giderse<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 85.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 39.7 39.7 39.7 47.2 47.2 55.4 55.4 62.2\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 62.2 69.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> artık bu evsaf ile muttasıf olanların <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"285\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 285.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.7 42.7 42.7 47.2 54.7 61.4 78.7 85.4 92.2 92.2 99.0 99.0 99.0 108.0 115.4 131.2 142.4 142.4 158.2 158.2 167.2 167.2 175.4 175.4 183.0 189.7 198.7 198.7 207.7 223.4 223.4 240.0 250.4 250.4 257.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 30.7 61.4 85.4 189.7 207.7 240.0 257.2 269.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bütün amelleri, islâm halinde yaptıkları hasenatın hepsi Dünyada ve Ahırette haptolur, telâfisi kabil olmıyacak bir surette tutulur, hakkı hayatı kalmaz, mesaisi heder olur gider<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"87\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 39.7 39.7 39.7 47.3 47.3 55.4 55.4 62.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 62.3 70.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bunlar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 134.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 24.7 31.4 31.4 38.2 45.7 61.4 61.4 78.0 84.7 97.4 97.4 111.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.4 84.7 111.0 117.7\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> eshabı nardırlar.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"151\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 151.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 51.7 79.4 86.3 94.4 101.3 101.3 117.0 117.0 126.0 126.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 58.4 58.4 86.3 135.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o ateşte muhalled kalırlar. Acaba o günah kıtali yapan Eshabı seriyye ne olacak derseniz? </p>"}